{
  "comment": "Licence sources for every pkg-config package linked into the FFmpeg bundle (subplan 17, task FFB-07). Keys are pkg-config package names; {version} is the version pkg-config reports. URLs are tried in order. A package missing from this table fails the bundle workflow.",
